 "introduction_text": "<p>Use this form if you paid for your membership before this system existed and have no online payment to point to — a receipt, a stamped record book, or a similar record. You are not asked to pay again: attach what you have, and the branch will verify it.</p><p>Your details are held on your profile with the society, and one profile is all you will ever have here: if you have already registered as a volunteer or a member, this is the same record.</p>",
